<title>USA: N.Y. certificated cotton stocks rise to 197,923.</title>
<headline>N.Y. certificated cotton stocks rise to 197,923.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of June 4 totaled 197,923 bales compared with 197,572 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 351 bales issued, 542 bales awaiting review, no cancellations, and 3,973 decertification orders.</p>
<p>((-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640))</p>
